  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘……『W.I.N.G.』惜しかったな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あと少し……あと少しやったばってん……\r\nあとほんの少しで優勝やった……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400107/6004001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "悔しいなぁ……\r\nもうちっとうちに実力があれば……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400107/6004001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今回は優勝できなかった\r\nだが、俺は恋鐘がこの敗北を糧にしてくれると信じてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なにせ恋鐘はダメだった時こそ頑張るって知ってるからな\r\n今回ダメでも恋鐘なら絶対にまた輝ける",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ホントにそう思っとると？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400107/6004001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ずっと恋鐘を見てきた俺が保証する",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ダメだった時こそ頑張る……\r\nそうやね。それがうちやね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400107/6004001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーにそこまで言われたら\r\n挫ける訳にはいかんばい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400107/6004001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004001070060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
